    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d15">

                <pb facs="0119" n="23" sameAs="frus:frus1874/pg23"/>

                <head>No. 13.<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Fish to Mr. Jay.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1874-04-29"><hi rendition="#italic">April</hi> 29,
                        1874</date>.</dateline>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 404.]</seg></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I inclose herewith a copy of a letter of
                    the 27th instant, from Judge Wm. T. Otto, arbitrator on the part of the United
                    States before the American and Spanish Claims Commission, and of its
                    accompanying letter addressed by Baron Lederer to the arbitrators of the two
                    governments, resigning the position of umpire to the said commission.</p>
                <p>You are requested to express the regret with which the President learns of the
                    retirement of Baron Lederer from duties for which he has shown such
                    qualification, and the sense of the President of the ability and learning with
                    which the baron has devoted himself to their performance,</p>
                <p>You will also request the minister for foreign affairs to be pleased to convey to
                    Baron Lederer the thanks of the President for the valuable services rendered by
                    him in the interest of the two governments represented in the commission.</p>
                <p>I am, &amp;c.,</p>
                <closer><signed>HAMILTON FISH.</signed></closer>




                <xi:include href="d15-a1.xml" xpointer="d15-a1"/>
                <xi:include href="d15-a2.xml" xpointer="d15-a2"/>
